+---
+id: task-004-bulk-task-import-helper
+type: task
+title: "Bulk task import helper"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add the public `importTasks(list, text)` helper. It reads non-blank lines in
+`title;priority;tags` form, adds each valid task, and reports the imported count plus rejected line
+numbers and reasons. An empty priority selects the existing normal-priority default; tags are
+space-separated.
